## 1. DepositSignatoryList

```
GET /api/DepositSignatoryList
```

| Query | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `page` / `per_page` | int | No | Pagination (default 50, max 200) |
| `signatory_id` | int | No | Exact id |
| `account_id` | int | No | Signatories of one account |
| `cust_id` | int | No | Rows where this member is a signatory |
| `branch_id` | int | No | Account branch |
| `is_active` / `status` | bool | No | `1` / `0` |
| `keyword` / `search` | string | No | Member name, ref code, mobile, account appl no / holder name |

Sorted by account (newest first), active rows first, then in the order added.

```bash
curl -X GET "http://116.193.129.229:8080/api/DepositSignatoryList?account_id=10&is_active=1" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -H "Accept: application/json"
```

### Success `200`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Signatories retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "signatory_id": 2,
