## 2. DepositSignatoryAdd

```
POST /api/DepositSignatoryAdd
```

Adds one or more signatories to an account. All are saved together or none are; errors are prefixed with `Signatory N:` when more than one is sent.

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `account_id` | int | Yes | Deposit account |
| `signatories` | array | Yes | 1 – 10 items |
| `signatories.*.cust_id` | int | Yes | Member id (see *Who can sign*); no repeats in the request |
| `signatories.*.sign_file_nm` | string | No | Max 75 |
| `signatories.*.photo_file_nm` | string | No | Max 75 |

```json
{
  "account_id": 10,
  "signatories": [
    { "cust_id": 9041, "sign_file_nm": "sign_9041.png", "photo_file_nm": "photo_9041.jpg" },
    { "cust_id": 9042 }
  ]
}
```

### Success `201`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "2 signatories added successfully",
  "data": [ { "signatory_id": 1, "...": "list item" }, { "signatory_id": 2, "...": "list item" } ]
}
```

