## 3. DepositSignatoryEdit

```
POST /api/DepositSignatoryEdit
```

`signatory_id` (required) plus `sign_file_nm` and/or `photo_file_nm`. Fields left out keep their current value; send `null` to clear.

```json
{ "signatory_id": 2, "sign_file_nm": "sign_9042_v2.png" }
```

### Success `200`

Returns the updated signatory row.

