## 4. DepositSignatoryStatus

```
POST /api/DepositSignatoryStatus
```

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `signatory_id` | int | Yes | Signatory id |
| `is_active` | bool | Yes | `true` / `1` activate, `false` / `0` deactivate |

```json
{ "signatory_id": 2, "is_active": false }
```

### Success `200`

Returns the signatory row. Same status again → `200` *Signatory is already active / inactive*. Activation can fail with `422` when the member is inactive, has left the group / is no longer a holder, or is already active on the account.

---

## Errors

| HTTP | When |
|------|------|
| `401` | Unauthorized |
| `404` | Signatory / deposit account / signatory member not found |
| `422` | Validation; closed account; inactive member; not a member of the account's group; not an account holder (non Authorised Signatory accounts); duplicate active signatory |

